Feature: Admin routes when signed out
  Every admin route but sign-in and sign-out turns a signed-out visitor away before it writes anything.

  Scenario Outline: A signed-out visitor is turned away from <method> <path> and nothing is written
    Given I count the rows in every table
    When I send <method> "<url>" with a CSRF token
    Then I am turned away to sign in
    And every table but the request timings holds the rows it did

